    "sections": {
        "description": "VIMart – Minimal Market is a modern and flexible WordPress theme designed for online stores. The theme comes with multiple pre-built presets and layout options, allowing users to create a variety of homepage designs easily. With the drag-and-drop homepage layout manager, you can customize and build unique homepages without any coding knowledge. VIMart also features an AJAX-powered shopping cart, providing a smooth and modern shopping experience for customers, while full compatibility with Elementor allows you to design attractive, dynamic, and highly customizable pages. Optimized for performance and fully responsive, VIMart ensures your online store looks great on all devices, making it a perfect choice for both beginners and experienced web creators who want to build a professional and visually appealing e-commerce website."
    },
